OL,3,AStudents wait for GCSE and BTec grades
OL,4,Aas app launches for 750 schools in
OL,5,AEngland
OL,6,
OL,7,FResults this year come as the
OL,8,Fgovernment in England plans to boost
OL,9,Ftechnical education and address a
OL,10,Fgrowing number of English and Maths
OL,11,FGCSE resits.
OL,13,FLast year, 67.4% of all GCSE entries
OL,14,Fwere graded 4/C or above.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
