OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AAustralia 'outraged' after Israeli
OL,4,Adecision not to prosecute over killing
OL,5,Aof aid worker in Gaza
OL,6,
OL,7,FForeign Minister Penny Wong said the
OL,8,Fdecision "falls far short of the
OL,9,Faccountability we expect" and called in
OL,10,Fthe Israeli ambassador.
OL,12,FWCK said the decision was "inconsistent
OL,13,Fwith the full truth" and that the
OL,14,Fmilitary investigation "conflates
OL,15,Fdifferent timelines and events" and
OL,16,F"shifts the blame for the IDF's illegal
OL,17,Fconduct".
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
