OL,3,ATrump threatens 'tremendous economic
OL,4,Aconsequences' on any country helping
OL,5,AIran
OL,6,
OL,7,FPresident Donald Trump has said the US
OL,8,Fwill inflict "TREMENDOUS Economic
OL,9,FConsequences" on any country that helps
OL,10,For does business with Iran.
OL,12,FHe wrote in all capital letters on
OL,13,FTruth Social that he was launching "the
OL,14,Fmost crushing economic operation ever
OL,15,Ftaken against any country!" He gave no
OL,16,Ffurther details, and did not name any
OL,17,Fother nation.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
